        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 7015-630, 3-1/2 x 15 Commercial Bathroom Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3-1/2 inch x 15 inch door pull plate has a 6-3/4 inch pull handle. A commercial grade product, it is primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories, and stores. The Commercial Bathroom Door Pull is made of .050 inch thick stainless steel. It has a satin stainless steel finish. The Stainless Steel 3-1/2 x 15 Pull Plate comes packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-7015-630-specifications.gif?v=1704354511\" width=\"485\" height=\"331\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 7015-630 Push Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/commercial-bathroom-door-push-plate-don-jo-70-630\"><b>3-1/2 x 15 Satin Stainless Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 7015-630 3.5 x 15 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Center to Center (CTC): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-7015-630-specifications.pdf?v=1704262341\"><b>Don-Jo 7015-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i> \r\n</p>",
